{"id":"vod_bf_38112","vodId":"38112","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"相合之物","name_cn":"相合之物","date":"2022-01-01","year":"2022","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-39/887e66c330be58196bfdc9c14af973c5.jpg"},"summary":"纳野和（岛崎信长 配音）曾经为了追寻梦想离开了家乡，来到东京独自打拼，如今，在得知了父亲生病住院的消息后，纳野和决定返回阔别了十年的老家，并且继承家中一直在经营的点心店绿松，担负起作为家中长子的责任。　　哪知道，当纳野和回到店里时，发现店中有一个陌生人正在忙碌，那就是店铺的看板娘雪平一果（结木梢 配音），与此同时，她也是店铺的候补继承人。一果对纳野和并没有什么好脸色，并不是因为纳野和回来会导致她的地位不保，而是因为她一直认为当初纳野和离开家乡前往东京的行为是对于店铺和家庭的背叛。就这样，纳野和与一果开始了共同生活共同工作的日子。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-04-29 22:53:05","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xianghezhiwu/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xianghezhiwu/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xianghezhiwu/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xianghezhiwu/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xianghezhiwu/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xianghezhiwu/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xianghezhiwu/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xianghezhiwu/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xianghezhiwu/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xianghezhiwu/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xianghezhiwu/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xianghezhiwu/第12集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:30:07.624Z"}